{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15206270","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15206270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1520627001:1":{"text":"可恶，怎么还是让马修跑了？！这下怎么交代？！","source_cn":"可恶，怎么还是让马修跑了？！这下怎么交代？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EE45F5310EC78A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520627002:1":{"text":"你们两个到底是干什么的，怎么不分青红皂白上来就打人啊！","source_cn":"你们两个到底是干什么的，怎么不分青红皂白上来就打人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E91197E76343638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520627003:1":{"text":"等等，<male>他</male><female>她</female>旁边那个是——兽人？！列队，列队！","source_cn":"等等，<male>他</male><female>她<...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B6CC99E558BD97","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"等等，<male>他</male><female>她</female>旁边那个是——兽人？！列队，列队！","female":"等等，<male>他</male><female>她</female>旁边那个是——兽人？！列队，列队！","variant_male_record_index":"182872","variant_female_record_index":"182873","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520627004:1":{"text":"停手！\n我见过这两个人，他们曾与珀尔修斯统帅同行。","source_cn":"停手！\\n我见过这两个人，他们曾与珀尔修斯统帅同行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3988609B1DBE7B8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520627005:1":{"text":"我们应当尊重统领的意见，对这两人保持友善。","source_cn":"我们应当尊重统领的意见，对这两人保持友善。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D5B4BF90DB9EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1520627005":{"text":"我们应当尊重统领的意见，对这两人保持友善。","source_cn":"我们应当尊重统领的意见，对这两人保持友善。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D5B4BF90DB9EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520627006:1":{"text":"他们有些冲动，但也是出于善意的无奈之举。他们是为了<style=\"highlight\">保护马修</style>，才在哨卡前阻拦他的。","source_cn":"他们有些冲动，但也是出于善意的无奈之举。他们是为了<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA26290895AF521E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520627008:1":{"text":"这事说来话长……是因为马修的女儿，奎莉。","source_cn":"这事说来话长……是因为马修的女儿，奎莉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CD738AC413A6E28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520627009:1":{"text":"奎莉是一位英勇的士兵。遗憾的是，在占领水泽营地的战斗里，作为先锋指挥官的她死在了兽人手里……","source_cn":"奎莉是一位英勇的士兵。遗憾的是，在占领水泽营地的战斗里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x193CD96C7701E2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520627010:1":{"text":"那场战争太过惨烈，我们甚至没能替她收尸。","source_cn":"那场战争太过惨烈，我们甚至没能替她收尸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07EAE7D7A1DC4B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520627011:1":{"text":"那是你们的错。你们不该进攻水泽营地。","source_cn":"那是你们的错。你们不该进攻水泽营地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9A0F7028FB6FF50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520627012:1":{"text":"冷静点，小兽人。看在珀尔修斯统帅的份上，我不会和你计较。","source_cn":"冷静点，小兽人。看在珀尔修斯统帅的份上，我不会和你计较。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4C2C34942215250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1520627013:1":{"text":"在奎莉死后，马修的精神就出现了问题，时不时就想偷偷穿越哨卡，前往深壑另一边。我们担心他是想去找兽人复仇，白白送命，所以才会严加阻止。","source_cn":"在奎莉死后，马修的精神就出现了问题，时不时就想偷偷穿越...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB89AEDA29F6B0EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520627014:1":{"text":"但你们也看到了，以他现在的状态，不管说什么他都听不进去。我们只能靠武器逼他退回去。","source_cn":"但你们也看到了，以他现在的状态，不管说什么他都听不进去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26359DC5DA70D4C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1520627014":{"text":"但你们也看到了，以他现在的状态，不管说什么他都听不进去。我们只能靠武器逼他退回去。","source_cn":"但你们也看到了，以他现在的状态，不管说什么他都听不进去。我们只能靠武器逼他退回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26359DC5DA70D4C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_m